**Project:** Om Ayurveda | Enterprise Digital Brand Infrastructure
**Stack:** Full-Stack Decoupled (Headless) Ecosystem
**Infrastructure:** Vercel (Frontend) + Hostinger (Backend API)
**Compliance:** WCAG 2.1 & Core Web Vitals (Optimized)
